{
  "$description": "Master editable token file for the Earnly design lab prototype. `base` reproduces TOKENS-BASE.json (V0) plus documented lab-only roles; each family stores only its differences. Run `node prototype/tools/build-tokens.mjs` after editing to regenerate css/tokens.css. Values are CSS px approximating iOS points.",
